Subject: [PATCH 7/7] audio: reduce ES8311 I2C success log noise

Keep I2C transaction-entry and error diagnostics visible during bring-up, but
demote the per-register successful write completion trace to DEBUG. This
reduces UART pressure while retaining the last entered register transaction
when a transfer blocks.

Apply after 0006-es8311-worker-boundary-diagnostics.patch.

diff --git a/drivers/audio/es8311.c b/drivers/audio/es8311.c
--- a/drivers/audio/es8311.c
+++ b/drivers/audio/es8311.c
@@ -369 +369 @@ static int es8311_writereg(FAR struct es8311_dev_s *priv,
-          syslog(LOG_INFO,
+          syslog(LOG_DEBUG,
